<title>AUSTRALIA: News says U.S. TV results up, film down.</title>
<headline>News says U.S. TV results up, film down.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rupert Murdoch's News Corp Ltd said on Wednesday earnings from its U.S. television operations were up in the year to June 30, 1997, but operating profit was down marginally in its U.S.-based Filmed Entertainment unit.</p>
</text>
